{
 "_what": "The three operating points the installer and the boot script install and start: every file with its pinned source, the engine env and argv, the ports, the readiness probe and the identity. tools/check_stack.py validates it (offline; --online re-checks bytes, sha256 and revisions against Hugging Face). Keys starting with _ are documentation, the convention of manifests/operating-point.json.",
 "_status": "published = in our Hugging Face repo at the pinned revision; only our own work is there (the CNQ containers and their companion files). mirror-pending = our own file that is still to be uploaded to our repo at repo/path (the upload happens on the owner's word); until then fetch it from source, whose sha256 is the file's. upstream = a third-party file, fetched from its original repo at the pinned revision: the owner, 2026-10-03, nothing foreign is mirrored or repacked into our repos. Uploading a mirror-pending file moves the repo revision and rewrites its SHA256SUMS: update revision, the SHA256SUMS entry and the status, then run tools/check_stack.py --online.",
 "_paths": "Every path starts with a placeholder; no absolute path is written here. Forward slashes; the installer converts them for the platform.",
 "schema": "crow-stack/1",
 "placeholders": {
  "INSTALL": "the install root (Windows: %LOCALAPPDATA%\\Crow; Linux: $XDG_DATA_HOME/crow, by default .local/share/crow in the home folder)",
  "MODELS": "the models root: $CROW_MODELS when set, else ${INSTALL}/models (Crow cli/crow_platform.py models_dir)"
 },
 "_lib_path": "Folders Boot puts in front of LD_LIBRARY_PATH for serve and sd-server, per platform (cli/crow_boot.py plan_point; #341). Linux: ${INSTALL}/bin holds the NVRTC libraries beside serve (CrowSetup takes them from NVIDIA's wheel, nvidia_files; libnvrtc has no RUNPATH and cudarc dlopens bare names), ${INSTALL}/cuda/lib the CUDA runtime and cuBLAS that sd-server links (also from NVIDIA's wheels). Windows: none; a program finds its DLLs beside it.",
 "lib_path": {
  "linux": [
   "${INSTALL}/bin",
   "${INSTALL}/cuda/lib"
  ]
 },
