   "non_commercial": false,
   "show_at_install": true,
   "text_file": null,
   "_text_file": "Microsoft publishes the text at url (last updated October 1, 2025); Crow does not copy it. The five DLLs are Distributable Code of Visual Studio 2026, and its licence requires that end users agree to terms that protect them at least as much: these are Microsoft's own end-user terms for exactly these files.",
   "summary": "The Windows package carries five unmodified Microsoft runtime DLLs the llama.cpp and stable-diffusion.cpp builds import. Installing Crow means you accept Microsoft's licence terms for them."
  }
 },
